            "review_text": "MattwalesNorthWales\nChengdu, China2829 contributions\n0\nStandard Bar in the Back Packers area\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nA big music sports bar in the back-packers district. Serves generic western and Vietnamese food. Loud live music in the front and large generally empty area at the back. Food was really nothing special, but at least it was edible and the service was prompt and efficient.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 2, 2025",
